<%-include('partials/header')%>

<h1>Rockpool Explorer</h1>
<p>Lift the rocks to find the creatures hiding underneath!</p>

<div class="rockpool">
  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Shore crab</h2>
      <p>Crabs walk sideways and can grow back a lost claw!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Starfish</h2>
      <p>Starfish have no brain, but they can see with eyes at the end of each arm!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Sea anemone</h2>
      <p>Anemones look like flowers, but they're animals that catch food with sticky tentacles.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Prawn</h2>
      <p>Prawns clean other animals by nibbling off tiny bits of food.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Limpet</h2>
      <p>Limpets clamp onto rocks so tightly that waves can't wash them away.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rock-spot">
    <button type="button" class="rock" aria-label="Lift a rock">🪨</button>
    <div class="creature" hidden>
      <h2>Blenny</h2>
      <p>Blennies can wriggle out of the water and wait on rocks for the tide to come back.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<p id="found-count" role="status">You found 0 of 6 creatures.</p>

<%-include('partials/footer')%>